<title>PHILIPPINES: Filinvest Land 9-mth net 1.4 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Filinvest Land 9-mth net 1.4 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	     1.80  vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	   1.40  vs 0.657</p>
<p>Note: Full name Filinvest Land Inc. The company attributed the surge in income to its residential housing projects.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8937</p>
</text>
